# title: The Locked Archive

// Inventory: one Boolean per item (the host game may mirror these; see NarrativeController).
VAR has_archive_key = false // Archive Key
VAR curiosity = 0

-> archive_entry

=== archive_entry ===
// Archive Entrance (source line 6)
Rows of shelves vanish into the dark. A steel door blocks the inner vault. #id:l_3f5288
- (line_mira_the_archive_is_locked) MIRA: The archive is locked. #speaker:mira #id:l_7423ec
+ {has_archive_key} [Open the archive #id:archive_entry_open_the_archive]
