=== find_key ===
// Reading Room (source line 16)
Dust motes drift over a long oak table. #id:l_48425a
~ curiosity += 1
+ {(not has_archive_key)} [Lift the loose floorboard #id:find_key_lift_the_loose_floorboard]
    -> found_key
+ [Return to the entrance #id:find_key_return_to_the_entrance]
    -> archive_entry

=== found_key ===
// Under the Floorboard (source line 25)
Wrapped in oilcloth: a heavy iron key. #id:l_e83c76
~ has_archive_key = true
-> find_key

=== archive_inside ===
// The Vault (source line 33)
The archive door opens. Inside, a single ledger glows faintly. #id:l_6d6b3e
- (line_mira_every_story_we_ever_lost) MIRA: Every story we ever lost. #speaker:mira #id:l_9bf36f
-> END

=== outside ===
